X13.devices
===========

Firmware section for project X13.Home
Version 3.3.0

Automation System oriented to "Smart House" - IoT, over MQTT(SN) protocol

Configuration names

  <uC family><PHY1>[PHY2][PHY3]<hardware version>, for example S4SMC14:
  STM32F3 (S4), PHY1 - UART (S), PHY2 - RS485 (M), PHY3 - CC1101 (C), hardware 1.4

  uC families: S2 - STM32F0, S3 - STM32F1, S4 - STM32F3, S5 - STM32L0,
               S6 - STM32L1, A1 - ATMega328P, A4 - ATMega2560, A5 - ATMega2561
  PHY letters: S - UART, C - CC1101, E - ENC28J60, M - RS485, Q - RFM69, R - RFM12

  Up to version 3.1.3 a device without PHY2 carried the placeholder letter n,
  as in S2Cn13. The placeholder is gone, so that device is now S2C13 and the
  _declarer every node reports changed accordingly.

Devices, STM32 - all of the below build with arm-none-eabi-gcc

  uC: STM32F051 - ARM Cortex M0
    S2C13       PHY1 - CC1101
